# Kept minimal and safe rather than clever: excludes things that are either
# huge and irrelevant to a build (node_modules, .git) or definitely
# regenerated inside the build itself (webapp/dist, the TS API client) —
# not every directory unrelated to a Go/webapp build, so a future addition
# elsewhere in the repo doesn't silently start missing from image builds.
.git/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
webapp/src/apiclient/
tg
tg.exe
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
cover.out
coverage.html
